@main
TOS Demo — User tasks

Tasks use kernel syscalls:
  sleep(ticks) — block for N timer ticks (100 ticks ≈ 1 second)
  putc(char)   — write character to stdout

Expected output:
  A
  A
  B
  A
  A
  B
  ...
@

  import services.*

@api task_a() — Prints 'A' every ~1 second.

  task_a()
      while true
          putc(65)            // 'A'
          putc(10)            // newline
          sleep(100)          // ~1 second

@api task_b() — Prints 'B' every ~2 seconds.

  task_b()
      while true
          putc(66)            // 'B'
          putc(10)            // newline
          sleep(200)          // ~2 seconds
